<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>

  <!-- EN: organized storage racks -->
  <ArmorRacks_BasicRackResearch.label>整理储物架</ArmorRacks_BasicRackResearch.label>
  <!-- EN: Build armor racks to keep sets of apparel neatly organized and free from deteriorating. -->
  <ArmorRacks_BasicRackResearch.description>解锁建造盔甲架，把成组的服装整理归位并防止其老化。</ArmorRacks_BasicRackResearch.description>

  <!-- EN: mechanized armor rack -->
  <ArmorRacks_MechanizedArmorRackResearch.label>电力盔甲架</ArmorRacks_MechanizedArmorRackResearch.label>
  <!-- EN: Produce mechanized armor racks that help your colonists quickly change apparel to respond to emergencies. -->
  <ArmorRacks_MechanizedArmorRackResearch.description>解锁制造电力盔甲架，帮助殖民者快速更换服装以应对突发状况。</ArmorRacks_MechanizedArmorRackResearch.description>

  <!-- EN: mending armor rack -->
  <ArmorRacks_MendingArmorRackResearch.label>修复盔甲架</ArmorRacks_MendingArmorRackResearch.label>
  <!-- EN: Produce mending armor racks that repair stored equipment via mechanites, in addition to other benefits. -->
  <ArmorRacks_MendingArmorRackResearch.description>解锁制造修复盔甲架，借助机械素修复存放的装备，并具备其余全部功能。</ArmorRacks_MendingArmorRackResearch.description>

</LanguageData>
